QuestGuidance.Register("en",272,{
[8673]="70072EA3\n1\tComplete Mission: Bound for Torment\tYour mission is to go to Kôth Rau and free the prisoners the Ordâkhai are holding there. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi Jiret-menêsh\tYou have completed your mission of setting the tents and banners at Onabóha on fire. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[8674]="700583ED\n1\tDefeat Ushgoth the Mighty in Bekâr-zarakh\tYour mission is to defeat Ushgoth the Mighty, the captain of the Orcs in Bekâr-zarakh.\n",
[8675]="70058423\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Breaking Bekâr-zarakh'\tYour mission is to defeat Ushgoth the Mighty, the captain of the Orcs in Bekâr-zarakh. You should talk to Hórin and travel to Bekâr-zarakh.\n2\tTalk to Hórin\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Hórin for your reward.\n",
[8676]="7005A81F\n1\tDefeat Angmarim warg-breeders (total: 4)\030Defeat poisonous wargs (total: 10)\030Destroy warg cages (total: 10)\tYou should defeat Angrmarim warg-breeders, poisonous wargs, and destroy warg cages.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the dungeon\tYou should return to the entrance of dungeon.\n",
[8677]="7005A82F\n1\tComplete Mission: Breeders of Beasts\tYour mission is to defeat the Angmarim Warg-breeders in Gundabad. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8678]="70062BEA\n1\tKill half-orcs (total: 15)\030Slay the half-orc captain\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8679]="7006330D\n1\tComplete the Mission: Brigands in Nímbarth\tAt the ruins of Nímbarth, a band of ruffians and brigands assaults the populace and lays waste to the beauty of the once great ruins. You are tasked with going forth and eliminating the brigand leader and their followers.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver\tAfter defeating the brigands, you should return to the mission giver and tell them of your success so that you may receive your well-earned rewards.\n",
[8680]="70059557\n1\tComplete Mission: Brooding in the Depths\tYour mission is to defeat the spider menace within the mines of Writhenset. Speak to Radhril.\n2\tTalk to Radhril\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Radhril for your reward!\n",
[8681]="7005956C\n1\tPick up the summoning horn\tUse the summoning horn at the beginning of the tunnel to summon Radhril to your side.\n2\tUse the Call Radhril skill and talk to Radhril\tYou should talk to Radhril. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n3\tDefeat Writhenset brood-mothers (total: 2)\030Destroy spider nests (total: 12)\tYou should defeat Writhenset brood-mothers and destroy spider nests. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n4\tReturn to the spider tunnel entrance\tYou should return to the entrance of the spider tunnels. If Radhril is missing, and the Call Radhril skill is not available, try using the /pet release command.\n",
[8682]="7005CB57\n1\tComplete Mission: Buried, but Not Forgotten\tYour mission is to record etchings of the deceased dwarves in the excavated tomb. Speak to Horin to travel to Atkat-darag\n2\tTalk to Horin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Horin for your reward!\n",
[8683]="7005CB58\n1\tInvestigate sarcophagi (total: 11)\030Defeat tomb-robbers (total: 12)\tRecord etchings from the dwarf-sarcophagi in Atkat-darag, and defeat the tomb-robbers.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the tomb\tYou should return to the entrance of the tomb.\n",
[8684]="70057F0A\n1\tDestroy stone-claw burrows (total: 4)\030Clear the stone-claw menace from the Hadhodiant (total: 8)\tClear the stone-claw menace from the Hadhodiant.\n",
[8685]="70057F50\n1\tComplete Mission: Burrowers by the Hadhodiant\tYour mission is to clear the stone-claw menace from the Hadhodiant. Speak to Ausma to travel to the Hadhodiant.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8686]="7005A823\n1\tComplete Mission: Captive Wings\tYour mission is to thwart Angmarim bat-keepers in Gundabad. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8687]="7005A827\n1\tDestroy vile draughts (total: 12)\030Free fledgling bats (total: 10)\030Defeat Angmarim bat-keepers (total: 8)\tDefeat Angmarim bat-keepers, destroy their vile draughts, and free the fledgling bats.\n2\tReturn to the entrance of the dungeon\tYou should return to the entrance of dungeon.\n",
[8688]="70062BED\n1\tDefeat Orcs at the Caranost Command Post (total: 12)\030Defeat Krovlut\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8689]="70062C72\n1\tComplete the Mission: Caranost Command Post\tEnter the ruins of Caranost and scour the command area for the leader of the Orc forces there. Scouts say that it bears the symbol of the White Hand. This should make identifying the true enemy easier.\n2\tReturn to the mission giver and tell them of your victory\tWith your victory over the White Hand Orc leader secured, you should return to the mission giver and inform them of the victory. There is sure to be a reward for your efforts.\n",
[8690]="70062BF2\n1\tClear the Orcs out of the courtyard at Caranost (total: 15)\t\n2\tFind the Scout\t\n",
[8691]="70062C71\n1\tComplete the Mission: Caranost Courtyard\tSpeak with the mission giver and let them know that you are prepared to make your way to the courtyard at the foot of Caranost. There you will face off against the slavering Orc horde.\n2\tTalk to Baglan\tWith the courtyard cleared, you must now return to the mission giver and let them know of your success.\n",
[8692]="7005CAC9\n1\tEnter the cavern\tEnter the cavern.\n2\tRescue the miners (total: 8)\030Defuse powder kegs (total: 12)\030Exit the cavern after rescuing the miners and defusing the powder kegs!\tRescue the miners and defuse the powder kegs before the cave collapses completely! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[8693]="7005CAD2\n1\tComplete Mission: Cave In!\tYour mission is to rescue miners from the partially collapsed cave of Mesem-gairu. Speak to Ausma to travel.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8694]="70062D04\n1\tSlaughter Hobbits to Draw out the Mayor\t\n2\tHunt Down Mayor Wat Mudbottom\t\n",
[8695]="7006C131\n1\tComplete Mission: Chickens Home to Roost\tYour mission is to help a local farmer outside Urmâkh round up his escaped chickens. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have helped Mushêndu recover his lost chickens! Return with the scout to Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8696]="70071E00\n1\tComplete Mission: Chopping the Woods\tYour mission is to go to the Moulder-grove. Bring peace to the restless trees and set fire to their progeny, that they may not spread further into Kighân. Speak to Jôrlar to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Jôrlar in Zajâna\tYou have defeated the restless trees and scorched their venturous growths. Return with the scout to Jôrlar in Zajâna with this report.\n",
[8697]="70059856\n1\tSeal blade-beak burrows at Gabilshathûr (total: 8)\tYour mission is to aid the dwarves of Gabilshathûr in repelling an infestation of blade-beaks.\n2\tRally to the centre of Gabilshathûr\tYour mission is to aid the dwarves of Gabilshathûr in repelling an infestation of blade-beaks.\n3\tDefeat the massive blade-beak\tYour mission is to aid the dwarves of Gabilshathûr in repelling an infestation of blade-beaks.\n",
[8698]="7005985D\n1\tComplete 'Mission: Claws of Gabilshathûr'\tYour mission is to aid the Dwarves of Gabilshathûr in repelling an infestation of blade-beaks. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to Gabilshathûr.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8699]="70070CCB\n1\tComplete Mission: Cleansing the Rotten Wood\tYour mission is to travel to Hordírid to the north-west to stop the dangerous Huorns and to cleanse the corrupted trees in the area. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully defeated the Huorns of Hordírid and cleansed the corrupted trees in the area.\n",
[8700]="7005B5E7\n1\tDestroy rubble piles (total: 6)\030Mine ore (total: 10)\tYou should gather ore and clear rubble piles.\n2\tRegroup near the entrance to the cave\tYou should regroup near the entrance to the cave.\n",
[8701]="7005B5E8\n1\tComplete Mission: Clearing a Path\tYour mission is to recover precious ore and clear a path through the cave-claw cave. Speak to Ausma to travel to cave-claw cave.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8702]="7006EC08\n1\tComplete Mission: Clearing the Southern Road\tYour mission is to investigate the area where there have been many reports of brigands and put a stop to them and their leader, Ulâmul the Talon. Speak to Setokúli to travel.\n2\tTalk to Setokúli\tYour mission is to investigate the area where there have been many reports of brigands and put a stop to them and their leader, Ulâmul the Talon.\n",
[8703]="70057F10\n1\tCollapse the first tunnel\tCollapse the old mining tunnels.\n2\tCollapse the second tunnel\tCollapse the old mining tunnels.\n3\tCollapse the third tunnel\tCollapse the old mining tunnels.\n4\tCollapse the final tunnel\tCollapse the old mining tunnels.\n",
[8704]="70057F52\n1\tComplete Mission: Collapsing the Old Paths\tYour mission is to collapse the old mining tunnels in Glimmerdeep. Speak to Ausma to travel to Glimmerdeep.\n2\tTalk to Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
